Description: Security service for Ubuntu systems to lock down devices
 A security service for Ubuntu systems designed to lock down devices
 when they are lost or stolen. The system can only be unlocked by
 connecting a specific Android device with the configured serial number.
 .
 Features:
  - Permissive/Enforcing mode operation
  - Android device-based unlock mechanism
  - Configurable service management
  - Comprehensive logging
  - CLI management tool
